- Treat Forgejo as the only destination for code pushes and pull requests.
- Use the `forgejo` MCP tools for PRs, issues, and repo file reads.
- Do not add GitHub Actions or push implementation code to GitHub.
- Never log or commit secret values; reference environment variable names only.
- Respect Cloudflare Access headers configured by `scripts/agent-git-setup.sh`.